From: 0cwa <0@none.org>
Date: Thu, 5 Nov 2026 12:18:20 +0100
Subject: [PATCH] Fix lint errors in the Signal 8.33.2 port

- RegistrationNavigation: log through the file's TAG constant (LogTagInlined).
- values-night/dark_colors.xml: comment out five quote_view colors that the merge
  restored from Signal. Molly reads these colors from theme attributes and keeps the
  color entries commented out in both color files; the live night-only entries had no
  default (MissingDefaultResource).

Carry this AI-assisted source change as its own
reviewable patch, preserving the original source author and diff.
The official Molly snapshot and earlier resolution patches do
not receive regenerated provenance headers.

Source-Commit: 316b16bf38514723fedcd71a2aa7a4a5a30f6081
AI-Generated: true

diff --git a/app/src/main/res/values-night/dark_colors.xml b/app/src/main/res/values-night/dark_colors.xml
